VoiceIsolatorMLX
Copyright 2026 Dmitry Starkov

A port of the Inworld Voice Isolator to MLX Swift.

The network architecture, the inference semantics (offline rendering and the
streaming session) and the model weights are those of the Inworld Voice
Isolator, Copyright 2026 Inworld AI, released under the Apache License 2.0:
https://github.com/inworld-ai/voice-isolator
https://huggingface.co/inworld/voice-isolator

Sources/VoiceIsolatorMLX/KernelSources.swift contains an erf approximation
adapted from MLX (MIT License, Copyright 2023 Apple Inc.), after N. Juffa's
faithfully rounded erff.

Sources/VoiceIsolatorMLX/TorchWindow.swift holds the float32 values of
torch.hann_window(2048) (PyTorch, BSD-3-Clause).
